{"applicability_conditions":"适用于立方晶系多晶体材料（本文为 Fe–Mn–Al 合金），采用 Voigt–Reuss–Hill 近似，该近似被认为是评价多晶体材料力学性能的最佳方法；要求体系满足力学稳定性条件（式(3)）。","identity":{"block_id":"b0035","equation_id":"equation_004","equation_number":"4","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\nB _ {\\mathrm{VRH}} = B _ {\\mathrm{R}} = B _ {\\mathrm{V}} = \\frac {1}{3} \\left(C _ {1 1} + 2 C _ {1 2}\\right)\\tag{4}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1007_s12598-018-1074-2"},"latex":"B_{\\mathrm{VRH}} = B_{\\mathrm{R}} = B_{\\mathrm{V}} = \\frac{1}{3}(C_{11} + 2C_{12})","purpose":"利用 Voigt–Reuss–Hill (VRH) 近似计算多晶体材料的体模量 B；对立方晶系，Voigt 体模量与 Reuss 体模量相等，均由弹性常数 C11 和 C12 确定。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"由 Voigt–Reuss–Hill 近似确定的多晶体体模量","symbol":"B_{\\mathrm{VRH}}","unit":"GPa","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Reuss 近似给出的体模量","symbol":"B_{\\mathrm{R}}","unit":"GPa","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Voigt 近似给出的体模量","symbol":"B_{\\mathrm{V}}","unit":"GPa","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"弹性刚度常数（弹性常数）C11","symbol":"C_{11}","unit":"GPa","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"弹性刚度常数（弹性常数）C12","symbol":"C_{12}","unit":"GPa","value":null}],"unmapped":[]}